  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Sometimes I build up alot of static electricity ( Its cold , im wearing clothing and have long hair ) , Sometimes when i go to adjust my headset by hand and or when my face contacts the surface of the headset ( not the face plate , sometimes my forehead or nose hits somewhere ) It will shock me a little, no biggie except once it does this my vrc avatar will put its hand in the afk animation and prevent me from using locomotion and or any of the menus, I still have full tracking of my entire body and arms but it just wont let me move around (locomotion) and wont let fix it unless i restart the game. Again it only applies the animation to my hands and my lower legs twist a little bit, but i still have fullbody tracking and everything , i can physically walk around, but not move my avatar using my controllers. also my fingers are frozen in the afk position.",
